<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boeing reinstated as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boeing reinstated as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said on Tuesday it reinstated coverage of Boeing Co with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- The aircraft maker's shares rose 1/2 to 96-7/8 in early trade.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
